Output out.mp4
# apify actors search instagram
Set Theme { "background": "#292B2E", "foreground": "#FFFFFF", "cursor": "#FFFFFF", "selection": "#3A3D40", "black": "#292B2E", "white": "#FFFFFF" }
Set FontSize 28
Set Width 3840
Set Height 2160
Set TypingSpeed 150ms
Set Margin 40
Set Padding 40

Sleep 800ms
Type `apify actors search "instagram"`
Sleep 700ms
Enter
Sleep 8s
